    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλχαίνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλχη</span>)
		prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make purple</i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be purple</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				641
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρω</span>), <i>make dark and
				troublous</i>
			like a stormy sea, <i>ponder deeply</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἔπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ τέκνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>long, desire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1457
			</span></i>; cf. sq.</div>
